(1)A Data Protection Council has been established at the Federal Ministry of Justice. The Data Protection Council shall comment on questions of fundamental importance for data protection, promote the uniform further development of data protection, and advise the Federal Government on legal policy in the case of projects relevant to data protection.

|  (2)Zur Erfüllung seiner Aufgaben nach Abs. 1

|  (2)To fulfil its duties pursuant to para. 1,

